    "catalog:tags": "corner unit, base unit, kitchen unit, cabinet, kitchen",
    "catalog:note": "L-shaped corner base unit: a run along the back wall and a return along the left wall, the second wall at x -0.45. top 0.90. Worktop 0.04 on a cabinet with a plinth 0.15 high set back 0.05 behind the doors. Each layer is two abutting parts. A right-hand corner is the mirrored block.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "EN 1116 co-ordinating sizes as given in the drafting standard key dimensions (600 module, worktop 0.90, worktop 0.04); EN 1116 itself not read, unverified. The 0.90 x 0.90 corner module is usual practice, not checked against a published source",
